      "widgets_values": [
        "Image2Prompt",
        "output:",
        1,
        "(use running model)",
        "",
        "Write a single, final image-generation prompt for an image.\nIn a single concise paragraph describe:\n\n1) The main subject: age, ethnicity, body type and proportions\n2) Clothing and accessories, fashion styles\n3) Body posture, pose, and  position in frame\n4) Physical attributes for each character such as skin color, hair color, eye color and ethnicity\n4) Environment, time of day, and background\n5) focal length, lighting, angle, focus, exposure, framing\n\nRules:\n1. Focus on recreating the original composition, capturing the details that make this image unique and interesting. prioritize capturing any compositional details or anomalies.\n2. Never use words like: appears, seems, looks like, likely, possibly.\n3. Do not omit nudity or anatomy where it is visible.\n4. Do not include watermarks, urls or signatures.\n5. Output only the photographic prompt. End after the last sentence.\n6. Use clear, direct, factual sentences.\n8. Do not omit text unless fit conflicts with rule 4.\n9. If the image is not photorealistic then make sure to mold the prompt according to its artstyle",
        false,
        513,
        0.2,
        0.9,
        40,
        0.05,
        1.1,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        "randomize",
